WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.904
Conversation requires fair turns, relevant questions, clarification requests and

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.517
respectful responses to others' points.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:12.911
Which greeting suits a visitor in the afternoon? Answer: Good afternoon; welcome.

00:00:13.783 --> 00:00:18.894
Discuss making your school greener. Ask one clarifying question and give a reasoned

00:00:18.894 --> 00:00:19.287
reply.

00:00:20.117 --> 00:00:23.210
Why it works: The greeting matches the time and occasion.
